File: src/fit_field.cpp
Function: Field::GetScale
One decode of the test corpus takes about 358.548 ms.

Rewrite this function to make decoding faster:
```cpp
FIT_FLOAT64 Field::GetScale() const
{
    if ((profile == NULL) || (profileIndex >= profile->numFields))
        return 1;
    return profile->fields[profileIndex].scale;
}
```
